OL,3,GNEWSAHow a broken London bridge has
OL,4,Asplit a community
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deserted and slightly forlorn bus
OL,7,Fstop will give you a clue that all is
OL,8,Fnot well with Broadmead Road Bridge in
OL,9,FWoodford, north-east London.
OL,11,FThere hasn't been a bus here for more
OL,12,Fthan three years - or for that matter a
OL,13,Fcar, a lorry or a van.
OL,15,FSafety concerns led to the bridge,
OL,16,Fwhich crosses the Central line, being
OL,17,Fclosed in July 2023. Financial concerns
OL,18,Fmean it hasn't yet been fixed.
OL,20,FThe local council, Redbridge, says it
OL,21,Fcan't afford the #100m it would take,
OL,22,Fso has asked the government to step in.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
